{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團BIGBANG近日襲港在啟德連開四場演唱會，場場座無虛席，氣氛熱烈，令一眾V.I.P（粉絲暱稱）興奮不已。昨日（16日）再有網民於社交平台分享偶遇權志龍（G-Dragon）的片段，拍到他現身尖沙咀嘉蘭圍。</p><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG在啟德連開四場演唱會。(ig@xxxibgdrgn)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199171831689515008789546.jpeg/4RHU5keJyMVftUj4nMozFbTlgk4Bv4On0GfqUNBn6lA\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG在啟德連開四場演唱會。(ig@xxxibgdrgn)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有網民於社交平台分享偶遇權志龍。(小紅書圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199171829118275584738246.jpeg/u4cV2-10-lzKH7OkKck4aMy3Mp4BcShmrrXgga614IE\"/><figcaption>有網民於社交平台分享偶遇權志龍。(小紅書圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>粉紅恤衫現身暗巷 保安嚴密護送上房車</p><p>片中可見G-Dragon疑似晚飯後離開，他身穿粉紅色恤衫、戴上藍色Cap帽，神情從容。他在多名保安及工作人員護送下，經昏暗後巷步出，現場保安高度戒備，陣仗十足。大批粉絲早已在門外守候，見偶像現身即興奮高呼「Oppa！Oppa！」不過，G-Dragon未有特別回應，隨即登上黑色房車離開。</p><figure><img alt=\"G-Dragon尖沙咀被網民捕獲。(小紅書圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199171929911595008912058.jpeg/fqKveKZWxiEJNYmvre2XL11fVrSQTFuREDVu9hA1bvY\"/><figcaption>G-Dragon尖沙咀被網民捕獲。(小紅書圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:27:21.644264+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":3,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:27.233314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:58.081134+00:00","content_hash":"cfe4b678c5b0ea749a389e28f0bedaf9234295d8d10d3705f2a6ab15905b97a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}